---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Careers" description="Work at Arvore. Build product with AI-first workflows.">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 pt-24 pb-16">
    <article
      class="prose prose-gray max-w-none
      prose-headings:font-semibold prose-headings:tracking-tight
      prose-h1:text-3xl sm:prose-h1:text-4xl prose-h1:text-gray-900
      prose-h2:text-lg prose-h2:text-gray-900 prose-h2:border-b prose-h2:border-gray-100 prose-h2:pb-3
      prose-h3:text-base prose-h3:text-gray-800
      prose-a:text-brand-600 prose-a:no-underline hover:prose-a:underline
      prose-code:text-brand-700 prose-code:bg-brand-50 prose-code:px-1.5 prose-code:py-0.5 prose-code:rounded prose-code:text-sm prose-code:font-normal prose-code:before:content-none prose-code:after:content-none
      prose-pre:bg-gray-50 prose-pre:border prose-pre:border-gray-200 prose-pre:rounded-xl
      prose-pre:prose-code:text-inherit prose-pre:prose-code:bg-transparent prose-pre:prose-code:p-0
      prose-strong:text-gray-900
      prose-table:border-collapse
      prose-th:border prose-th:border-gray-200 prose-th:bg-gray-50 prose-th:px-4 prose-th:py-2 prose-th:text-gray-700 prose-th:text-sm prose-th:font-medium
      prose-td:border prose-td:border-gray-200 prose-td:px-4 prose-td:py-2 prose-td:text-sm
      prose-li:marker:text-gray-300
      dark:prose-invert
      dark:prose-h1:text-gray-100
      dark:prose-h2:text-gray-100 dark:prose-h2:border-gray-800
      dark:prose-h3:text-gray-200
      dark:prose-a:text-brand-400
      dark:prose-code:text-brand-300 dark:prose-code:bg-brand-950/50
      dark:prose-pre:bg-gray-900 dark:prose-pre:border-gray-800
      dark:prose-strong:text-gray-100
      dark:prose-th:border-gray-700 dark:prose-th:bg-gray-900 dark:prose-th:text-gray-300
      dark:prose-td:border-gray-700
      dark:prose-li:marker:text-gray-600"
    >
      <h1>Careers at Arvore</h1>

      <p>
        We build real product for real schools across Brazil and the United States. We ship fast, but we don't ship reckless.
        We're hiring product engineers who can thrive in AI-first workflows.
      </p>

      <div class="not-prose mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center gap-3">
        <a
          href="https://arvore.gupy.io/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex justify-center rounded-full bg-gray-900 px-6 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-white transition-all hover:bg-gray-800 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-gray-900/10 dark:bg-gray-100 dark:text-gray-900 dark:hover:bg-white dark:hover:shadow-gray-100/10"
        >
          See open roles
        </a>
        <a
          href="/docs/product-engineer"
          class="inline-flex justify-center rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-white px-6 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 transition-all hover:border-gray-300 hover:text-gray-900 dark:border-gray-700 dark:bg-gray-900 dark:text-gray-400 dark:hover:border-gray-600 dark:hover:text-gray-100"
        >
          Product Engineer role details
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="not-prose mt-10 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-gray-900">
        <img
          src="https://attachments.gupy.io/production/companies/1668/career/2537/images/2025-01-23_00-40_imageUrl_2_0.jpg"
          alt="Product Engineer at Arvore"
          loading="lazy"
          class="h-auto w-full"
        />
      </div>

      <h2>Why work at Arvore?</h2>

      <p>
        At Arvore, you find a dynamic, welcoming environment where every idea matters and collaboration makes a difference.
      </p>

      <ul>
        <li><strong>Work model</strong>: hybrid and flexible (Tue/Wed/Thu at the office for most teams). The Technology team works 100% remote.</li>
        <li><strong>Health plan</strong>: medical and dental coverage.</li>
        <li><strong>Benefits card</strong>: meal allowance + home office support (Caju).</li>
        <li><strong>Transportation</strong>: commute covered with no additional discounts for you.</li>
        <li><strong>Wellhub</strong>: support for physical and mental well-being.</li>
        <li><strong>Grow with us</strong>: stock options plan available through an annual application process.</li>
        <li><strong>Rest is part of the job</strong>: extended holidays, Carnival week off, end-of-year break, and a birthday day off (not discounted from your 30 vacation days).</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>About Arvore</h2>

      <p>
        We believe in the transformative power of education. Our mission is to promote access to knowledge and foster reading habits for students across Brazil and the United States.
      </p>

      <ul>
        <li>350k+ educators use Arvore to transform education</li>
        <li>20k+ connected schools</li>
        <li>4M+ students impacted (10% of all students in Brazil)</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Our values</h2>

      <ul>
        <li><strong>Sow autonomy with responsibility</strong>: we truly care about the business and commit to self-development.</li>
        <li><strong>Cultivate respect, assertive empathy, and trust</strong>: we respect our plurality and build psychological safety.</li>
        <li><strong>Grow engaged readers and ambassador schools</strong>: we work relentlessly to earn the admiration of our partner schools, delivering quality and innovation in product and service.</li>
        <li><strong>Harvest results with smart effort</strong>: we set ambitious goals, pursue agility, and execute with responsibility.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Tech stack</h2>

      <ul>
        <li><strong>Backend</strong>: Node.js, NestJS, TypeScript, REST APIs</li>
        <li><strong>Web</strong>: Next.js</li>
        <li><strong>Mobile</strong>: React Native</li>
        <li><strong>Datastores</strong>: MySQL, PostgreSQL, Redis, Elasticsearch</li>
        <li><strong>Observability</strong>: Datadog</li>
        <li><strong>Async processing</strong>: SQS</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>What a product engineer means here</h2>

      <p>
        We use AI heavily. Your job is to turn product goals into crisp requirements, direct agents effectively,
        and review the output with rigor: correctness, security, performance, and maintainability.
      </p>

      <p>
        If that sounds like your kind of work, start with the role overview:
        <a href="/docs/product-engineer">Product Engineer (Hiring)</a>.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
